# FM-86 presets hold the DX7's own parameter values as JSON (FM-86's
# controls are the DX7's), imported from the factory cartridges; the banks
# live in subfolders and ARE committed:
#   presets/rom1a/ … presets/rom4b/  (import: tools/dx7_import.py rom1a.syx presets/rom1a)
# Loose imports dropped straight into presets/ stay local scratch — the
# leading-slash anchor ignores only this directory's top level, not subfolders.
/*.preset
